  "description": "TUJNOC crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H98 K1 Nd3 O16. From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.770-3.826 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.67-105.16°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C84H98KNd3O16.",
